          "proof": {
            "resolved": true,
            "meaning": "The NLTL_v2 UNION checks each Polar validity/survey/endorsement date against an equal SOLAS schedule date of the same category; the Single-shot query checks the reverse join. In F01 the validity dates differ. In F05 the NLTL_v2 survey branch has no schedule record. The other date categories remain matched.",
            "query_sha256": "08eab78e77bfcafcfa0e430c9a5dc56702a395289578ad53653f21b2fc577582",
            "query": "\n            PREFIX nltl: <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#>\n            PREFIX sh: <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#>\n            PREFIX xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>\n\n            SELECT $this\n            WHERE {\n                {\n                    $this nltl:polarCertificateValidityDates ?date .\n                    FILTER (datatype(?date) = xsd:date)\n                    FILTER NOT EXISTS {\n                        $this nltl:hasSolasCertificateSchedule ?schedule .\n                        ?schedule nltl:hasCertificateScheduleDateRecord ?record .\n                        ?record nltl:certificateScheduleDateType nltl:validityDateCategory ;\n                                nltl:certificateScheduleDate ?scheduleDate .\n                        FILTER (datatype(?scheduleDate) = xsd:date)\n                        FILTER (?scheduleDate = ?date)\n                    }\n                }\n                UNION\n                {\n                    $this nltl:surveyDates ?date .\n                    FILTER (datatype(?date) = xsd:date)\n                    FILTER NOT EXISTS {\n                        $this nltl:hasSolasCertificateSchedule ?schedule .\n                        ?schedule nltl:hasCertificateScheduleDateRecord ?record .\n                        ?record nltl:certificateScheduleDateType nltl:surveyDateCategory ;\n                                nltl:certificateScheduleDate ?scheduleDate .\n                        FILTER (datatype(?scheduleDate) = xsd:date)\n                        FILTER (?scheduleDate = ?date)\n                    }\n                }\n                UNION\n                {\n                    $this nltl:endorsementDates ?date .\n                    FILTER (datatype(?date) = xsd:date)\n                    FILTER NOT EXISTS {\n                        $this nltl:hasSolasCertificateSchedule ?schedule .\n                        ?schedule nltl:hasCertificateScheduleDateRecord ?record .\n                        ?record nltl:certificateScheduleDateType nltl:endorsementDateCategory ;\n                                nltl:certificateScheduleDate ?scheduleDate .\n                        FILTER (datatype(?scheduleDate) = xsd:date)\n                        FILTER (?scheduleDate = ?date)\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        ",
            "source_clause": "Part I-A 1.3.6",
            "source_text": "Polar Ship Certificate validity, survey dates and endorsements shall be harmonized with the relevant SOLAS certificates in accordance with the provisions of SOLAS regulation I/14. The certificate shall include a supplement, recording equipment required by the Code.",
